  "body": "v16.41: prospective unit-barrier theorem and directed overlapping-profile campaign.\n\nThe universal unit-barrier question remains unresolved. This stage proves a unit-barrier theorem for all finite rooted no-unary trees with k equal to the number of leaves and q equal to internal outdegree. The 1,380 canonical partition-profile pairs validate the constructive paths. The directed overlapping target has 144 states, 12 exact-profile components and 66 component pairs; all have unit paths. No nonunit retained witness was found. Intrinsic indecomposability is not claimed.\n\nScope: all five canonical four-leaf trees, k=4, all 32 attained profiles; plus only the prospectively frozen q=(2,2,2,0,0,0,0,0) on the directed nested target. The 27 nonpartition canonical profiles are exact-connected and supply no nontrivial component pairs. All 1,898,176 admitted states and 15,872,668 edges are reconstructed, but the additional graph's other profiles are not barrier-tested.\n\nProvenance: verified integrated parent 1de55a8a1e416062ba05cdb0cdd13cf06fc3dfca; prospective preregistration a004aac10f49100a76adc360423af3d19b54b3b0; prospective addendum 8a97c212806f355e7e883696d2863f5ecef6c5e3; scientific source 54eeae226c0de54ae92f792f94d32d4a6b43e584; publication 948ef50a976aee60141877c8caec5612549e793b.\n\nRun https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36790083759 passed all 339 inherited + 48 new checks, two expected-failure controls, independent universe/graph/path verification, and fresh parent replay in both science and fresh publication reproduction. All scientific bytes reproduce. Root audit verified artifact ZIP digests, complete manifests, 1,372 source/input Git blobs, all 113 publication manifest entries, and unchanged scientific source.\n\nPrimary barriers remain three independent scalar minima; LEX is separate. The abstract barrier-2 control is not a retained witness.\n\nStatus: READY FOR MERGE; final certification requires actual-merge rerun and verified durable audit receipt.",
